ers/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":10,"created_at":"2025-06-13T14:50:35Z","updated_at":"2025-06-13T17:29:02Z","closed_at":"2025-06-13T16:39:13Z","assignee":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: v4.5.dev.custom_build [03bd8ba9c]\n\nRegression from #106952\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.dev (03bd8ba9c) - KISS Linux Community #22 SMP PREEMPT_DYNAMIC Sat May 24 15:48:21 CEST 2025 on Wayland - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - integrated AMD Radeon Vega 8 Graphics (RADV RAVEN) - AMD Ryzen 5 3500U with Radeon Vega Mobile Gfx (8 threads) - 5.66 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nFound this while testing the Wayland embedder PR. Confirmed with the `master` branch.\n\n![Game debug bar](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4cb1f823-8e3c-40db-a516-c634b600bb8c)\n\nWhenever I enable the \"Node2D\" or \"Node3D\" mode in the game debug bar (the one on top of the embedded game, pic above) and try to show the node selection list (either with `Ctrl+Alt+RMB` or with the dedicated selection tool) the game crashes with the following error:\n\n```\nERROR: Parameter \"data.tree\" is null.\n   at: get_tree (./scene/main/node.h:506)\n```\n\nApparently #106952 did not check for the tree before dereferencing it. Reverting it fixes the issue.\n\nI haven't made a PR because with the following patch the popup scale gets messed up and I have no idea why. This does not happen if I revert the aforementioned PR outright.\n\n```diff\ndiff --git a/scene/main/window.cpp b/scene/main/window.cpp\nindex 611b1e6950..d2a7b921ec 100644\n--- a/scene/main/window.cpp\n+++ b/scene/main/window.cpp\n@@ -1370,7 +1370,7 @@ void Window::set_force_native(bool p_force_native) {\n \t\treturn;\n \t}\n \tforce_native = p_force_native;\n-\tif (!is_in_edited_scene_root() && get_tree()->get_root()->is_embedding_subwindows()) {\n+\tif (is_inside_tree() && !is_in_edited_scene_root() && get_tree()->get_root()->is_embedding_subwindows()) {\n \t\tset_embedding_subwindows(force_native);\n \t}\n }\n```\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b4b8c938-0861-4252-93e1-a68a97f2612a)\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Run any game\n2. From the debug bar set selection node type to Node2D\n3. Either use `Ctrl+Alt+RMB` or the dedicated \"selection list\" mode to select something.\n4. Boom.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107491/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107491/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}